[[0,2067056,0,1,0,1,"2017-08-17T01:04:51","Mercury_Eunomia","",[],"","And \"Nazi\" needs to be slightly slanged like \"nigga\" for \"nigger\"","https://voat.co/v/whatever/2066799","whatever"]]
[[0,2067057,0,3,0,3,"2017-08-17T01:05:04","tame","",[],"<p>SO all my left-leaning friend are posting stuff about &quot;actually fighting Nazis&quot; and talking about swastikas and so forth. I've only seen a few photos (like, suspiciously few) of the protesters and counter-protesters, and there was nothing in there resembling a swastika. The torches thing was pretty melodramatic but it seems like a bit of a jump from torches to &quot;literally Nazis OMG&quot;. So what gives?</p>","Were there actual Nazis at Charlotteville?","","AskVoat"],[1,10198911,0,3,0,3,"2017-08-17T01:16:44","CapinBoredface","",[],"<p>Yeah, maybe 50-100 honest to god Nazis were there. The other several thousand right wing activists were not. </p>\n<p>I'd estimate the number of White Supremacists at about 500. But to most people KKK, White Supremacy, Nazi, and Alt Right are all the same thing.</p>"],[2,10199220,10198911,2,0,2,"2017-08-17T01:53:38","tame","",[],"<p>OK, so the usual thing where a few dropkicks were acting out and the media focused on them to make it as clickworthy as possible. Figures.</p>"],[3,10199441,10199220,1,1,0,"2017-08-17T02:17:30","CapinBoredface","",[],"<p>Not only that, but now literally <em>any</em> protest that goes against what (((they))) want will be a White Supremacist Nazi Rally.</p>"],[3,10206369,10199220,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T18:32:46","ICYBM","",[],"<p>Yeah except the media do the opposite if the attacker is Muslim or Black.</p>"],[1,10198940,0,2,0,2,"2017-08-17T01:19:15","lemon11","",[],"<p>The only fighters were against &quot;nazis,&quot; and they're not discriminate about who they label.</p>\n<p>The only reason it matters to your friends are because they think violence is the appropriate response to speech. Let them continue starting the war. They will lose.</p>"],[2,10199239,10198940,3,0,3,"2017-08-17T01:55:36","tame","",[],"<p>Yeah, I've generally been liberal-ish but 'progressives' have totally lost me. Demanding equal outcomes for all regardless of effort, insisting that existing-while-male is a microaggression, but punching someone for holding a different opinion to yours is fine? Screw them.</p>"],[1,10199569,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T02:34:55","8Ball","[e]",[],"<p>There weren't. The media is trying to paint a picture, so they can move forward with more and more false narratives. Those pierced and tattooed skinheads were paid LARPers. The organizer of the protest, Jason Kessler, was involved with the Occupy Movement not too long ago. You would more likely expect antifa cucks to have been affiliated with Occupy, not an &quot;actual Nazi&quot;. Those Nazis were as real as the &quot;money&quot; the federal reserve prints. The left has gotten so desperate for relevance that they've resorted to creating their own enemies. </p>\n<p>Edit: and of course the leftists are simply useful idiots for the real, bigger enemy: the globalist Zionist banksters. <a href=\"http://archive.is/zusyL\">It's another divide and conquer stratagem</a></p>"],[1,10201055,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T05:46:33","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p>Most Nazis would have to be wheeled in with wheel chairs.</p>\n<p>Those that you see today are no-Nazis and are mostly descendants of US military soldiers who killed Nazis and protected Jews.</p>\n<p>Irony is funny in that way.</p>\n<p>The question is who was there or even here that can claim to have had actual family or should I better put it as having 1 or 2 generations removed from family members that were nazis?</p>\n<p>Or how about members here who are aryans and have the RH- (still not sure what the fuck this O- blood type connection is all about) blood type? </p>\n<p>Makes me giggle when I get called a Jew! </p>"]]
