[[0,2067069,0,1,0,1,"2017-08-17T01:10:37","Skeeterdo","[e]",[],"<p>Unfortunately this civil war everyone is talking about scares the living shit out of me and I'll explain why.</p>\n<p>You see Syria was toppled for 1. <a href=\"https://i.imgtc.com/3BI1rdp.jpg\">Greater Israel</a> 2. The <a href=\"https://i.imgtc.com/I6yvSZK.jpg\">pipeline</a> that would give Europe a direct gas line through Israel.</p>\n<p>By Israel gaining this pipeline They. A. Gain resource control and B.make mega bucks (You know how much they love money)C. They gain far more land to expand</p>\n<p>As of now Europe buys a large majority of oil from <a href=\"http://energypost.eu/europe-increasingly-dependent-oil-imports-russia/\">Russia</a></p>\n<p>If Russia loses their oil sales they fall. They will literally crumble. Turkey also doesn't want this because then they lose control of the oil possibilities and the oil line that already goes through their country.\nRussia also has a trade deal with <a href=\"https://www.rt.com/business/389712-russia-iran-oil-goods/\">Iran</a> . When this oil pipeline gets established through Israel this trade deal with Iran disappears.</p>\n<p>Now imagine this. The single largest army in europe is russia. They will combine forces with Turkey and Iran. The only reason this war hasn't happened yet is because the united states. If the united states is in shambles or has trouble with a working government this trio will strike at the opportunity. What scares me though is when Israel is threatened like this by 3 major players they will <a href=\"http://www.thedailybeast.com/how-shimon-peres-outwitted-the-us-to-bring-nukes-to-israel\">nuke</a> them. Israel has fought tooth and nail to be established and has been behind every single war(Zionism). They will not give this land up for anything.</p>\n<p>This is my prediction let me know if you find holes or anything interesting. You can actually back some of this up biblically as well if you so wish.</p>\n<p>There is one hole I cant seem to fill though. Why is the zionist media wanting a civil war or is this still all just for ratings?</p>","A Prediction on this civil war everyone speaks about.","","whatever"],[1,10199581,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T02:36:40","ADaniels","",[],"<p>The &quot;civil war&quot; is just the usual regimen of terror/fear/chaos/control. And turkey, Russia, and Iran are in no shape to fight if china is allied with its largest trading partner aka USA. Just a slow bleed, or strangle, like a boa squeezing the last bits of life from its rivals as it devours their culture and resources completing the USA's NWO DESTINY. </p>"],[2,10199626,10199581,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T02:41:54","Skeeterdo","",[],"<p>As for the terror/control if you consider the fact that zionist hate the goys and that they'll profit tremendously off a civil war it's not too far fetched. If the dollar fails or if america is in no position to trade where does china go? China has friendly trade relations with Iran as well.</p>"],[3,10201821,10199626,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T08:27:02","ADaniels","",[],"<p>United States citizens make up 4 percent of the world's population but generate well over 25 percent of the wealth, we have a genetic dopamine disorder (what caused our ancenstors to immigrate) and it means No other country/race can actually compete in the next half century to full century until gene modifications and robot/clone armies etc.... </p>"],[1,10200032,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-17T03:30:24","dontforgetaboutevil","",[],"<p>Russia, Iran and Turkey can have Israel. Speaking as a full blood US citizen, born and raised those asiatics can tear each other limb from fucking limb for all I care. </p>\n<p>Frankly if the world is gonna end so be it. I just don't want the US to be responsible. I don't want my last minutes on earth spent recriminating myself. I want the flash to be set off by somebody else. Somebody else's fucking fault.</p>"]]
